-- Generated by functions/_arcadelab/build/publish-days.mjs. Approves Claude's drafts and
-- publishes 30 days from 2026-10-10 for Whack the Right Player and Drop Board.
-- Idempotent: a day already published is left alone; a prompt only Claude has drafted is refreshed.

-- --replace drop-board: a day nobody has played yet is taken down and published again.
